guard tested before the guard ran. **Those are the failures I am asking you to look for.**

## THE DIFF, VERBATIM AND COMPLETE

```diff
 	int sh = ((iw >> 11) & 31) | ((iw & 2) << 4);
 	int mb = ((iw >> 6) & 31) | (iw & 0x20);
 	int rc = ic->arg[0] & 1;
-	int m;
+	int m, n = sh;
