8438-144 PowerPC User Instruction Set Architecture
8439-Version 2.01
8440-
8441-Examples
8442-
8443-1. Decrement CTR and branch if it is still nonzero (closure of a loop controlled by a count loaded into CTR).
8444-
8445-bdnz target                                       (equivalent to:  bc 16,0,target)
8446-
8447:2. Same as (1) but branch only if CTR is nonzero and condition in CR0 is "equal".
8448-
8449-bdnzt eq,target                                   (equivalent to:  bc 8,2,target)
8450-
8451-3. Same as (2), but "equal" condition is in CR5.
8452-
8453-bdnzt 4*cr5+eq,target                             (equivalent to:  bc 8,22,target)
8454-
8455-4. Branch if bit 27 of CR is 0.
8456-
8457-bf 27,target                                      (equivalent to:  bc 4,27,target)
8458-
8459-5. Same as (4), but set the Link Register. This is a form of conditional "call".
8460-
8461-bfl 27,target                                     (equivalent to:  bcl 4,27,target)
--
8515-Branch if not equal              bne      bnea bnelr           bnectr bnel bnela bnelrl
8516-
8517-Branch if not greater than       bng      bnga bnglr           bngctr bngl bngla bnglrl
8518-
8519-Branch if summary overflow       bso      bsoa bsolr           bsoctr bsol     bsola bsolrl
8520-
8521-Branch if not summary overflow bns        bnsa bnslr           bnsctr bnsl     bnsla bnslrl
8522-
8523-Branch if unordered              bun      buna bunlr           bunctr bunl bunla bunlrl
8524-
8525-Branch if not unordered          bnu      bnua bnulr           bnuctr bnul bnula bnulrl
8526-
8527-Examples
8528-
8529:1. Branch if CR0 reflects condition "not equal".
8530-
8531-bne target                                              (equivalent to:  bc 4,2,target)
8532-
8533-2. Same as (1), but condition is in CR3.
8534-
8535-bne cr3,target                                          (equivalent to:  bc 4,14,target)
8536-
8537-3. Branch to an absolute target if CR4 specifies "greater than", setting the Link Register. This is a form of
8538-    conditional "call".
8539-
8540-bgtla cr4,target                                        (equivalent to:  bcla 12,17,target)
8541-
8542-4. Same as (3), but target address is in the Count Register.
8543-
